<section class="pv-transport-discovery" aria-labelledby="transport-discovery-heading"><p class="pv-eyebrow">Reviewed research · separate from AI</p><h2 id="transport-discovery-heading">Explore transport options</h2><div class="pv-note"><span class="pv-transport-pill"><%= discovery.state==='reviewed-enquiry'?'Reviewed enquiry candidate':'More research needed' %></span><p><%= discovery.summary %></p><% if(discovery.assistanceNote){ %><p><%= discovery.assistanceNote %></p><% } %><% if(discovery.transitNote){ %><p><%= discovery.transitNote %></p><% } %></div><div class="pv-discovery-grid"><% discovery.candidates.forEach(candidate=>{ %><article class="pv-itinerary-card"><p class="pv-eyebrow">Animal transport enquiry · <%= candidate.transportMode %></p><h3><%= candidate.name %></h3><p><strong><%= candidate.originAirportName %> (<%= candidate.originAirport %>) → <%= candidate.animalEntryAirportName %> (<%= candidate.animalEntryAirport %>)</strong></p><p><%= candidate.supportedClaim %></p><p><%= candidate.positioning %></p><ul><% candidate.constraints.forEach(item=>{ %><li><%= item %></li><% }) %></ul><a class="pv-button" href="<%= candidate.enquiryUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official cargo enquiry ↗</a><p class="pv-fine-print"><%= candidate.operatingCarrierStatus %> No quote or booking is created. Research checked <%= candidate.reviewedAt %>; review due <%= candidate.reviewDue %>.</p><ul><% candidate.sources.forEach(source=>{ %><li><a href="<%= source.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%= source.name %> ↗</a></li><% }) %></ul></article><% }) %><article class="pv-itinerary-card"><p class="pv-eyebrow">Your passenger journey</p><h3>Explore passenger flights</h3><p>A passenger search does not reserve pet cargo space. Confirm the operating carrier on every leg, including codeshares.</p><a class="pv-button" href="<%= discovery.passenger.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Search passenger flights ↗</a><p class="pv-fine-print"><%= discovery.passenger.note %></p><p><a href="/getCountryRegulationList">Research country requirements</a> · <a href="/regulations/airlineList">Explore airline policies</a></p></article></div></section>
